            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true'>1-year Profit ROI is calculated in steps. Profit over Cost (-1), each time for actual data (during Observation period) and for forecasted data (during Extrapolation period):</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' underline='true'>Profit:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Actual Profit over Observation period: </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>Actual Incremental orders x Actual GPO </run>
                <run><![CDATA[
<[federated.0nwwivx1ony7tk1g9glpj0e3a9pk].[usr:Observation Period Order Frequency Test (copy)_1776458989817323529:qk]> x <[federated.01xid240azqgio100ibyh12r7uyh].[min:actuals_aov_l2m:qk]> = <[federated.0nwwivx1ony7tk1g9glpj0e3a9pk].[usr:€ Profit (Current - Option 1) (copy)_4930245376685346822:qk]>

]]></run>
                <run bold='true'>Forecasted Profit over Extrapolation period: </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>Option 1: Extrapolated incremental orders x Future GPO, where Future GPO = Best Estimate</run>
                <run><![CDATA[
<[federated.0nwwivx1ony7tk1g9glpj0e3a9pk].[usr:Actual Incremental Orders (8w) (copy)_1776458989818691595:qk]> x <[federated.01xid240azqgio100ibyh12r7uyh].[min:be_gpo:qk]> = <[federated.0nwwivx1ony7tk1g9glpj0e3a9pk].[usr:€ Profit - Actuals (tooltip) (copy)_4930245376685428743:qk]>

]]></run>
                <run italic='true'>Option 2: Extrapolated incremental orders x Future GPO, where Future GPO =  AOV x Target</run>
                <run><![CDATA[
